0,Music of Ladakh - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Ladakh,"The traditional music of Ladakh includes the instruments of Daman, surna and piwang (shehnai and drum). Chanting of mantras in Sanskrit and Tibetan language plays an important role in Ladakhi music.",Ladakhi,Sino-Tibetan
