2,Module 10-Music of Tibet and Ladakh - MUS 104-01 Exploring World Music ...,https://lib.jjay.cuny.edu/c.php?g=789686&p=5785930,"Over one hundred years ago the German missionary and ethnologist August Hermann Francke noted that ""the Ladakhi music and art of dancing is so entirely different from Tibetan music and dancing that non-Tibetan influences must be suspected"" (Francke 1904: 366).",Ladakhi,Sino-Tibetan
